```mermaid
flowchart TD
    %% Registration Flow
    A[register_spoke] --> B{Validate:\n- No duplicate spoke_id\n- No capability collision\n- Known definition/provider hashes}
    B -->|Valid| C[_append_event REGISTER]
    B -->|Invalid| D[Raise ValueError]
    
    C --> E[Write to spoke-ledger.jsonl\natomic: temp→replace→fsync]
    E --> F[append_audit\nappend_spoke_event]
    F --> G[Return SpokeEvent]

    %% Deregistration Flow
    H[deregister_spoke] --> I{Validate:\n- registration_id exists\n- registration_id active}
    I -->|Valid| J[_append_event DEREGISTER\ntombstone]
    I -->|Invalid| K[Raise ValueError]
    
    J --> L[Write to spoke-ledger.jsonl\noriginal REGISTER preserved]
    L --> M[append_audit\nappend_spoke_event]
    M --> N[Return SpokeEvent]

    %% Discovery & Folding
    O[discover_spokes] --> P[read_ledger]
    P --> Q[RegistryState{active={}, history=events}]
    Q --> R[fold_registry\nwith definitions + providers]
    
    R --> S{Validate each event}
    S -->|REGISTER| T[Add to active\ncheck duplicates + collisions]
    S -->|DEREGISTER| U[Remove from active\nhistory preserved]
    T --> V[RegistryState\nactive + history]
    U --> V

    %% Health Check
    W[is_healthy] --> X[Read raw ledger lines\nextract last_seen from REGISTER]
    X --> Y{For each active spoke:\nlast_seen exists?\n(now - last_seen) < max_age?}
    Y -->|Yes| Z[healthy=true]
    Y -->|No| AA[healthy=false]
    Z --> AB[Return dict[spoke_id, bool]]
    AA --> AB

    %% Capability Eligibility
    AC[can_accept_run] --> AD[is_healthy]
    AD --> AE[Filter active spokes\nby health]
    AE --> AF[Filter by capability coverage\nrequired ⊆ spoke.capabilities]
    AF --> AG[Return sorted ActiveRegistration[]]

    %% Ledger Verification
    AH[verify_ledger] --> AI[Recompute hash chain\nfrom seq=1]
    AI --> AJ{All event_hash match?\nNo seq gaps?\nprev_hash chain intact?}
    AJ -->|Yes| AK[OK]
    AJ -->|No| AL[Raise ValueError\nfirst bad entry]

